{"text": "In the evening the other soldiers. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Were put back into their box. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When the people went to bed. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The toys began to play. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The nutcracker was turning somersaults. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And the pencil was drawing. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> On the slate. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The canary woke up. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And began to talk in poems. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Only the tin soldier and the dancer. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Did not move at all. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She stayed on the tip of her toe. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And he stayed on his one leg. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He did not take his eyes off her. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Even for a moment. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At midnight. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The lid of the snuffbox. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Flew open. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There was no snuff inside. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Only a little black goblin. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Tin soldier. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Stop looking at what is not yours. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Said the goblin. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The soldier pretended not to hear. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So the goblin said. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Just wait until tomorrow.", "alignment": {"characters": ["I", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "e", "v", "e", "n", "i", "n", "g", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "o", "t", "h", "e", "r", " ", "s", "o", "l", "d", "i", "e", "r", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "W", "e", "r", "e", " ", "p", "u", "t", " ", "b", "a", "c", "k", " ", "i", "n", "t", "o", " ", "t", "h", "e", "i", "r", " ", "b", "o", "x", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "W", "h", "e", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "p", "e", "o", "p", "l", "e", " ", "w", "e", "n", "t", " ", "t", "o", " ", "b", "e", "d", ".